    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c4faea67c40cca4",
      "translationZh": "为了获得更精细的控制，用户可以利用 FullyShardedDataParallelPlugin，在其中指定 auto_wrap_policy、backward_prefetch 和 ignored_modules。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f261f5e479577115",
      "translationZh": "创建该类的实例后，用户可以在创建 Accelerator 对象时传入该实例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
